Libresomnia is a modified distribution of Kong/insomnia (upstream tag core@13.3.1).
Cloud services, telemetry (Segment, Sentry, Customer.io), automatic updates and the
proprietary @kong/* plugins have been removed; a local OpenAI-compatible AI plugin,
a fully functional local (scratchpad) organization and the Libresomnia branding have
been added. See README.md for the complete list of modifications.

